<title>USA: USDA adds $5 mln in rice to Philippine PL480 pact.</title>
<headline>USDA adds $5 mln in rice to Philippine PL480 pact.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department Friday said it amended a PL 480, Title I sales pact with the Philippines to provide for the sale of $5 million worth of U.S. rice.</p>
<p>USDA said the move boosts the Philippines' current Title I program to $15 million.</p>
<p>The supply period is fiscal year 1996.</p>
<p>Title 1, also know as the Food for Peace program, is a loan program for the purchase of U.S. farm goods with low interest rates and long-term payback periods.</p>
</text>
